---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "The Cellar — YaadWine"
description: "The YaadWine Cellar — stories of migration, science, and culture behind every bottle."
ogDescription: "Every story belongs somewhere. The growing archive of YaadWine's stories."
extraStyles: ["library"]
# Only cards that were actually rendered on the live site are listed here.
# The original cellar.html also had these draft ideas sitting in HTML
# comments (never rendered) — kept here for reference, not shown:
#   Migration: The Journey of Chenin Blanc / Why Georgian Wine Matters / Why Phylloxera Changed Everything
#   Science:   Yeast: The Invisible Migrant
#   Culture:   How Enslaved and Migrant Labor Shaped the Wine World
comingSoon:
  science:
    - title: "Smoke Taint Isn't Smoke Flavor"
      humanQuestion: "How can something invisible change what we taste?"
  culture:
    - title: "A Tale of Two Sweet Wines: How Stone's Original Ginger Wine and Jamaican Red Label Wine Became Jamaican"
      humanQuestion: "How did two bottles from somewhere else become part of Jamaica's celebration culture?"
permalink: cellar.html
---
{% import "partials/story-card.njk" as storyCard %}
<main class="library-page">

  <section class="library-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Archive</p>
    <h1>The YaadWine Cellar</h1>
    <p class="library-sub">Every story belongs somewhere. This is the growing collection of how the wine world became what it is — filed by the question it answers, not just the grape it's about.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="pillar-block" id="migration">
    <div class="pillar-heading">
      <span class="pillar-mark">01</span>
      <h2>Wine Through Migration</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="story-grid">
      {% for post in collections.post %}{% if post.data.pillar == "migration" %}{{ storyCard.published(post) | safe }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% for card in comingSoon.migration %}{{ storyCard.comingSoon(card) | safe }}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pillar-block" id="science">
    <div class="pillar-heading">
      <span class="pillar-mark">02</span>
      <h2>Wine Through Science</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="story-grid">
      {% for post in collections.post %}{% if post.data.pillar == "science" %}{{ storyCard.published(post) | safe }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% for card in comingSoon.science %}{{ storyCard.comingSoon(card) | safe }}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pillar-block" id="culture">
    <div class="pillar-heading">
      <span class="pillar-mark">03</span>
      <h2>Wine Through Culture</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="story-grid">
      {% for post in collections.post %}{% if post.data.pillar == "culture" %}{{ storyCard.published(post) | safe }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% for card in comingSoon.culture %}{{ storyCard.comingSoon(card) | safe }}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pillar-block drink-time-block" id="drink-time">
    <div class="pillar-heading">
      <h2>Drink Time</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="drink-time-intro">Not researched history — just an honest reaction to one bottle, whenever one actually changes how we see something. No set schedule. It shows up when it has something real to say.</p>
    <div class="story-grid">
      {% for post in collections.post %}{% if post.data.pillar == "drinktime" %}{{ storyCard.published(post) | safe }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
